  "description": "When a mountain tiger is hunted and killed, her wounded cub Sandu takes human form and leaves the wilderness, seeking aid from the nearby village's physician, Euiseo. The doctor takes him in and treats his injuries, but his unusual new patient becomes attached to him and doesn't want to leave his side. Will the medicine man really make Sandu leave when his wounds are healed, or has the young tiger found his mate?",
